  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}=\\sqrt[6]{64}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理 $3$ 如果 $a\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}=\\sqrt[nk]{a}$（$n$ 和 $k$ 是自然数）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}$ 的值是非负的。此外，式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}$ 的 $nk$ 次幂等",
        "于 $a$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上：",
        "$(\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}})^{nk}=((\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}})^n)^k=(\\sqrt[k]{a})^k=a$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，根据 $n$ 次算术根的定义，等式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}=\\sqrt[nk]{a}$（$a\\geqslant0$）",
        "是真等式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理 $4$ 如果 $a\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[nk]{a^{mk}}=\\sqrt[n]{a^m}$（$n$，$k$ 和 $m$ 是自",
        "然数）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据定理 $3$ 得到：",
        "$\\sqrt[nk]{a^{mk}}=\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a^{mk}}}=\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{(a^m)^k}}=\\sqrt[n]{a^m}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们已经证明，如果根指数和被开方式的幂指数同乘以",
        "或者同除以同一个自然数，那么根式的值不变。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "有时，我们把根式的这个性质叫做根式的基本性质（和分",
        "式的基本性质类似）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们举一个应用定理 $3$ 和定理 $4$ 的例子。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "化简 $\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把因数 $2$ 移到平方根号下面，得到：",
        "$\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^2\\times2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^3}}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据定理 $3$，得：$\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^3}}=\\sqrt[6]{2_3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "应用定理 $4$，得：$\\sqrt[6]{2^3}=\\sqrt{2}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，$\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt{2}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "478",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "478. 求下列各式的值："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
